    scoringRules: {
      summary: 'Marques are won or paid for: declarations (Tarots, Kings+Fool, Triomphes, Imperials, Brizigole, Tous les trois), playing or capturing Tarots in tricks, Ultimo (last trick with King or Trump I), and card points (Tarots 5, Queens 4, Cavaliers 3, Jacks 2; pack total 74). Below 25 points = loser pays winner(s); above 25 = winner collects.',
      winCondition: 'After the hand, the player(s) with above-average card points (25 or more) win; the player(s) with below average (24 or less) pay. Two losers each pay the single winner per 5-point band below 25; two winners each collect from the single loser per 5-point band above 25. Ultimo (last trick with King or Trump I) pays 6 marques from each opponent.',
